    "criteria": null,
    "includes_healthy_subjects": false,
    "registry_text": "Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Age ≥ 18 years.\n* Subject willing and able to provide written informed consent for biological sample collection.\n* Ability to communicate effectively with the investigator in the local language, as well as the ability to understand and comply with study requirements.\n* Histologically confirmed malignant melanoma.\n* Radiologically or histologically confirmed disease relapse.\n* Feasibility/possibility of peripheral blood sampling for ctDNA analysis.\n* Documented, known \\*BRAF\\* mutation status (wild-type vs. V600E).\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Operable disease relapse.\n* Age under 18 years.\n* Pregnant or breastfeeding women.\n* Patients receiving palliative care with an estimated life expectancy ≤ 3 months.\n* Severe alcohol and/or drug abuse during therapy.\n* Inability to obtain a valid biological sample for molecular analysis",
    "sexes": [
      {
